{title: Afsos}
{artist: Anuv Jain}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Haan, [Fm]teri yaadan, yaadan.. [A#],        Teri yaadan le ke [Cm]betha
[Fm]Kayin raatan, raatan.. [A#],        Par [Cm]aj [Fm]aina raatan pichchon.. [A#]
Mainu sab sach nazar ae [Cm]aunda,        [Fm]Kivein aakhan, aakhan?.. [A#]
Jo [Cm]guroor si, [Fm]o fizool si,        Mainu [A#]aj pata laga ki kasoor si
Mere [Cm]dil de noor, [Fm]main si mashoor,        Tainu [A#]karta door, o bekasoor
Kinj [Cm]gairan nu [Fm]main apna mann,        Mile [A#]ya mere apne nu gair ban
Ae [Cm]taan zaroor [Fm]dil karta choor te [A#]ra,        Te [Cm]haan, [Fm]main duniya vekhi.. [A#]
Tere dil nu vekh na [Cm]paya [Fm]mai challa challa [A#]
Karda si wadeya [Cm]naawan [Fm]di gallan, gallan [A#]
Hun aithe marda [Cm]jaanda [Fm]main kalla, kalla [A#]
Hun [Cm]kyun [Fm]afsos hoya [A#],        Hun ki fayda, mil [Cm]na ni
[Fm]Je chaahan, chaahan [A#],        Main [Cm]hun [Fm]kadiyaan de hath te [A#]
Kivein modan rukh sa [Cm]may da,        [Fm]Te raahan, raahan [A#]
Chand [Cm]pal, do pal teri sunda battan [A#]je
Tere [Cm]naal hi sab kat?da raatan [A#]je,        Tere [Cm]hanju dekhda vich barsataan [A#]je
Kitte [Cm]karda tai ae dil di baatan [A#]je,        Kaisi [Cm]shaam si, ter&#1077; [Fm]naam si
Jo [A#]padeya na main, ki paigham si,        Main [Cm]hairan si, naa [Fm]dan si
Kis [A#]gallon meri jaan pareshaan si,        Tainu [Cm]hasda v&#1077;kh ke [Fm]baar-baar
Tainu [A#]puchhi naa main kadey tere dil di saar
Tera [Cm]intezaar meri [Fm]samjhon baar,        Kiddan [A#]katey ne tu din meitho haar-haar
[Cm]Haan, jo [Fm]pyaar si tera [A#],        Thodavi samjh na [Cm]paya mai [Fm]challa challa [A#]
[Cm]Haan, ae [Fm]dil pachtaave [A#],        Tere bin hun reh na [Cm]pave [Fm]kalla kalla [A#]
Hun [Cm]kyun [Fm]afsos hoya [A#],        Hun ki fayda, mil [Cm]na ni
[Fm]Je chaahan, chaahan [A#],        Main [Cm]hun [Fm]kadiyaan de hath te [A#]
Kivein modan rukh sa [Cm]may da,        [Fm]Te raahan, raahan [A#]
